{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25423","headline":"到恶溪夜泊芦岛 · 李德裕","name":"到恶溪夜泊芦岛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"甘露花香不再持，远公应怪负前期。\n青蝇岂独悲虞氏，黄犬应闻笑李斯。\n风雨瘴昏蛮日月，烟波魂断恶溪时。\n岭头无限相思泪，泣向寒梅近北枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}